      },
      "note": [
        "The average prices before 2015 are unweighted, but starting from 2015, both unweighted and weighted average prices are available. The weighted average prices have been calculated based on the number of connection points for each grid company and respective consumer category. To maintain a long time series, the unweighted grid prices are also reported. This is because the method change impacts the outcome and affects the comparison with average prices from previous years."
